45665::$$$message_0434_0000_0000$$$::"I did it... I won... I actually beat Tokiomi...! I don't have to have a stable job to be happy![wait canskip=false time=100][hffacechg2 chara=雁夜 face=吐血 pos=winner time=300 textclear=0][hfchance layer=2] Guogh! (Cough! Hack! Cough!)"::
45666::$$$message_0434_0000_0001$$$::"You're a poor learner. The stimulation shortens your life, Kariya. You should harden your heart, let me knock you out with a gut punch, and... Sakura?"::
45667::$$$message_0434_0000_0002$$$::"Just let him be...for now. Uncle looks really happy."H]��